power_daemon reads /boot/system/settings/power_daemon. On startup, on
an AC event, and on the 'PwRl' message from the Power preferences app,
it calls set_scheduler_mode().

Off by default. No /dev/power/acpi_ac/0 means it leaves the mode alone.
status 1 is AC online, same as the old printf.

Conflicts with ac-adapter-log on ac_monitor.cpp. Do not apply both.
This one replaces the printf. ac-adapter-log is still not for Gerrit.

Needs the Power preferences app to write the file. Without that file
this does nothing.
